0440AD             0894*   ; Stream the current DATA payload into agnb_meta_bufferId in bounded blocks,
0440AD             0895*   ; then consolidate the completed VDP buffer. This routine is form-agnostic;
0440AD             0896*   ; callers perform image-, audio-, or other form-specific finalization.
0440AD             0897*   agnb_stream_data:
